{"id": null, "n": "0001001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0001001", "type": "orig", "text": "以因為善法之義，非因與善之法義，以下准此。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0029001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0029001", "type": "orig", "text": "於發趣論第二卷之三法發趣，譯為「已取所取」，使譯語之統一起見，以下即改為「已取順取」，意義無異。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0036001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0036001", "type": "orig", "text": "於發趣論第二卷之三法發趣，譯為「已染能染」而以下改為「已染順染」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0335001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0335001", "type": "orig", "text": "底本為積集趣以訂正之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0203a0401", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0203a0401", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，己【南傳】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0300a0101", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0300a0101", "type": "add", "text": "二【CB】，三【南傳】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0306a0101", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0306a0101", "type": "add", "text": "法【CB】，去【南傳】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0430a0701", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0430a0701", "type": "add", "text": "喜【CB】，［－］【南傳】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0430a0702", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0430a0702", "type": "add", "text": "［－］【CB】，三【南傳】"}
